    "headline": "McDonald's posts strong second quarter profit, names new chief of US operations",
    "summary": "McDonald's posted a strong profit in its second quarter and named a new chief of U.S. operations with sales at home under pressure as many Americans grow more cautious about spending.  McDonald’s said same-store sales, or sales at locations open at least a year, edged up 0.8% in the U.S. Global same-store sales rose 1.3%.  McDonald’s warned in May that high gas prices and consumer anxiety over the U.S. conflict with Iran could dent its sales.",
